<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-INSIGHT-Australian All Resources technicals overbought.</title>
<headline>RTRS-INSIGHT-Australian All Resources technicals overbought.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>-----------------------All Resources------------------------</p>
<p>S/Term Range *Res 1505 1530 1580 *RSI-14 72.58 *MA-10 1477.3</p>
<p>1425 - 1480  *Sup 1470 1460 1435 *MA-20 1442.8 *MA-40 1398.6</p>
<p>---------------Analysis by Daniel Fock - May 29-------------</p>
<p>*Consolidating at top of rise</p>
<p>*Technicals very overbought</p>
<p>*Cautious</p>
<p>*All Resources index closed at 1,483.7 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Australian All Resources consolidates between 1,470 and 1,505. Traders will continue to be aware that the index is overbought and overextended.</p>
